            "evidence":"Every requirement must terminate as FOUND, CAPTURED, GENERATE, NOT_REQUIRED, or BLOCKED with source, rights, usage status, path, and shot mappings where applicable.",
            "escalation":"Tool or rights ambiguity blocks the specific asset. Premium reasoning is not a substitute for missing source or licensing evidence.",
